#: 21402d8f164a4e1b8ad70c16af866668 ccd8b551158844609f2f9a2e705edba7
#: f4a6be10e78744edbb5b4d0a8c137639
msgid "Hobbywing DroneCAN ESC"
msgstr "Hobbywing DroneCAN ESC"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hobbywing-dronecan-esc.rst:11
#: 721e07e96aa546c4ae511c64b93b47b1 746d9374cef2471c90c56318f970c670
#: 8a1e39f82b584a089446b99c8dcea29a d9fb032b4a6b43ec8d8cdc2f05db9470
#: dee2df9a83124472a74eeffc289763e0
msgid ""
"Hobbywing ESCs with CAN interfaces (`including these "
"<https://www.hobbywing.com/en/products?id=46>`__) support DroneCAN which "
"allows the autopilot to control the ESC/motor via CAN and also retrieve the "
"individual rpm, voltage, current and temperature."
msgstr ""
"带 CAN 接口的 Hobbywing ESC（`包括这些 "
"<https://www.hobbywing.com/en/products?id=46>`__）支持 DroneCAN，允许飞控通过 CAN 控制 "
"ESC/电机，并获取各电机的转速、电压、电流和温度。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hobbywing-dronecan-esc.rst:13
#: 0f9ebb501aed49cc996cdbdafee08a14 20f715da99d34465a42611bd3403ffdb
#: 6f1ea66d6e6f40c8bdb068bdf224f049 7783170265154c0c980e69b131ba9fa3
#: 8e17d4a747c9449193a982c44da725b3
msgid ""
"be sure that the CAN version of the ESC is being ordered. Contact Hobbywing "
"if there is doubt. Some ESCs may require special ordering to get CAN "
"interface."
msgstr "请确认订购的是 CAN 版本。如有疑问，请联系 Hobbywing。某些 ESC 可能需要特别订购才能获得 CAN 接口。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hobbywing-dronecan-esc.rst:15
#: 0d3e695768d74f8d9ce92aa427a61a1d 3cdd26389cf74b9d972bc60cddc21004
#: 41a755e10f35442bb3e2d23e8e49d460 6afa17bc866b425282f8b51676254ac1
#: e705f9f7be5a4a018272a806d0eb971f
msgid ""
"The contents of this page were verified using a `Hobbywing X6 Plus "
"(6218-150KV CW motor) "
"<https://www.hobbywingdirect.com/collections/xrotor-x8-series/products/xrotor-"
"pro-x6-series>`__."
msgstr ""
"本页内容使用 `Hobbywing X6 Plus（6218-150KV 正转电机） "
"<https://www.hobbywingdirect.com/collections/xrotor-x8-series/products/xrotor-"
"pro-x6-series>`__ 验证。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hobbywing-dronecan-esc.rst:17
#: 37a6a59d204148518d14775ea7727a05 bcf4cf23d68a4b6ab7470a959b4b89bb
