msgstr "部分图片由 hobbywing.com 提供"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hobbywing-dronecan-esc.rst:20
#: 8869d45fcd484dd98624cf43a1074865 8c1bd4724f1d4654b896a5408e855017
#: dab9c896ed4a4503920113db6402ad09 dc2f31672fc644d29020e45ec82a1116
#: e0003226828d4a21b78f987970da9c74
msgid "Connection and Configuration"
msgstr "连接与配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hobbywing-dronecan-esc.rst:22
#: 0d3f67eff65a43a39f78b983370ef6ba 0f51145e163a424d83d688aa73be70c6
#: 8d636c55fa794947ad30dffb1b1e3cb0 bb5caded1fb547b194749e13f384667f
#: ec075847cdf1450e935a77ab3bfbc976
msgid ""
"Connect the ESCs (perhaps using a 4-pin I2C splitter) to the autopilot's "
"CAN1 (or CAN2) port."
msgstr "将 ESC（可使用 4 针 I2C 分线器）连接到飞控的 CAN1（或 CAN2）端口。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hobbywing-dronecan-esc.rst:24
#: 08c89c2f20234fbcb9635932b7fcf0a8 176a3534290a473292807a4109d05cc3
#: 4bd9f60970ab4db48aa6bd9fa4f58623 51c6b282c76f45fba2ea08b66cd106db
#: 7d362b87ba71480ca3a080fd42c74d57
msgid "the CAN_H wire color varies from red to gray depending on product"
msgstr "CAN_H 线颜色因产品不同而异，从红色到灰色不等"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hobbywing-dronecan-esc.rst:30
#: 29ac2b08662f4218ab2ee42a0e9e7358 6187d987768e4cf9ba090d75ceb6ff1b
#: 9c3fbe0ed4614272a7d109ff63fdac23 c1f74d59b8ad460890a4d0cef7bd1cf4
#: f0b1c038b4d145a4839cf000e970d323
msgid ""
"Connect to the autopilot with a ground station and set the following "
"parameters and then reboot the autopilot"
msgstr "使用地面站连接飞控，设置以下参数后重启飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hobbywing-dronecan-esc.rst:32
#: 415a3d1884c24ec381d01a77027ec6a0 5aa6571430e146669243df745b0aba03
#: 78714d939026447d94b8e2c54474f141 88aabbe01d884ab8aaad585088c4f12c
#: e995c3c36ea44d8f91e975621bf1a389
msgid "Set :ref:`CAN_P1_DRIVER<CAN_P1_DRIVER>` to 1 (First Driver)"
msgstr "将 :ref:`CAN_P1_DRIVER<CAN_P1_DRIVER>` 设置为 1（第一驱动器）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hobbywing-dronecan-esc.rst:33
#: 07e98b3bef144469b06098ee00900259 80b92dfd75fc473bb3562b9498cd126a
#: 8b9919ddb26e4b0eb0b1b5e85a34ae6a caeb648f81cf4cc98255ecc10f513120
#: e2581a78b59e4c76b79a05589beedde3
msgid "Set :ref:`CAN_D1_PROTOCOL<CAN_D1_PROTOCOL>` to 1 (DroneCAN)"
msgstr "将 :ref:`CAN_D1_PROTOCOL<CAN_D1_PROTOCOL>` 设置为 1（DroneCAN）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hobbywing-dronecan-esc.rst:34
#: 07df96c5baa446f58ef7822ecd2efcbc 5cd900ec79dc4722bd3719a2d3b2d189
#: 8365c90103164d178d361f74147d7d4d 90dd5113c5ce49e597b3467327853f5e
#: c48c89e2c57a49ecbca73b911c4f5f2e
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`CAN_D1_UC_ESC_BM<CAN_D1_UC_ESC_BM>` to configure which servo "
"outputs are transmitted over CAN.  For most quadcopters this should be set "
"to 15 to send outputs 1-4 to DroneCAN."
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`CAN_D1_UC_ESC_BM<CAN_D1_UC_ESC_BM>` 设置为配置通过 CAN "
"传输的舵机输出。对于大多数四轴飞行器，应设为 15 以将输出 1-4 发送到 DroneCAN。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hobbywing-dronecan-esc.rst:39
#: 061711b093ec4517994adc7930e7b9c9 152a5360d7a341339cbc7942b58ee0f1
#: 39576e1d8efb42c68f89ab7f060e70d2 8db4a2819c864549a83af12b79b92678
#: eb12eac7967a48ca9f55d2b05b1585f8
msgid ""
"Modify :ref:`CAN_D1_UC_OPTION<CAN_D1_UC_OPTION>` so that \"Hobbywing ESC\" "
"is checked (or directly set to 128)"
msgstr ""
"修改 :ref:`CAN_D1_UC_OPTION<CAN_D1_UC_OPTION>`，使「Hobbywing ESC」被勾选（或直接设为 128）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hobbywing-dronecan-esc.rst:45
#: 092e9ae968cd433ca190c84dc392dbf3 3ed1922d1fdf4ae5babf4f5b3e285d19
#: 8741367ddc254932a9fadf6eaca07e6c cefdbbbef8954a07a8c286aaa3f3c6e2
#: e856244ea80a4c22849d8abfe3ef97b5
msgid "Configuring the ESCs"
msgstr "配置 ESC"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hobbywing-dronecan-esc.rst:47
#: 14a816969ae34140884273663f81cd49 80f4eaaf3d984a38af7911aa8da6a6b5
#: 9b5f7d04d51e4c3583cb79e0a00023cf bae28c840b7a4c269b6eb12860ee6178
#: c26fc954eee94b399f9109e0aa192d46
msgid ""
"By default the ESCs come from the factory with an incorrect baudrate "
"(500,000 instead of 1,000,000) and all IDs are set to 1 (the first motor).  "
"The instructions below show how to configure the ESCs to use the correct "
"baudrate and individual ID for each ESC."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，ESC 出厂时波特率不正确（500,000 而非 1,000,000），且所有 ID 均设为 1（第一个电机）。以下说明展示如何配置 ESC"
" 使用正确的波特率和各自的 ID。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hobbywing-dronecan-esc.rst:49
#: 01fa72d4956e43518eb431ca64e137ee 0bb6df09d18e4a6da27207f2c9d18ae7
#: 3b964b7ea60d49a88d673c2b849031b4 87786386672e4ed4a12a95c7e660abb8
#: df611a6274064cb18c50b94fd2aed19c
msgid ""
"You may initially test that the ESCs can be spun in their factory "
"configuration by doing the following:"
msgstr "您可以按照以下步骤初步测试 ESC 在出厂配置下能否转动："

#: ../../source/docs/common-hobbywing-dronecan-esc.rst:51
#: 04410f5b3e444980aeec59bbda4fcb33 25472507eac54effb69d13d43112f773
#: 4954e22cc21c45f8bcfe62ac46f761fc 775522c3ee494c3ba24fd8a08cb9ad43
#: e33a255fcb0f4afd8be57c77b38c3126
msgid "Disconnect any other DroneCAN devices from the autopilot's CAN1 port"
msgstr "断开飞控 CAN1 端口的其他 DroneCAN 设备"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hobbywing-dronecan-esc.rst:52
#: 6f517c012427451386514fdaae1d70b7 7ee865bf98b34e538020859b6467d053
#: 868611014aaf4768af4f858d0b9aab90 9e5712bc432d497892a016f39ebdf3a0
#: e4ca5b43d88644aab891143c6aa37193
msgid ""
"Connect to the autopilot and set :ref:`CAN_P1_BITRATE<CAN_P1_BITRATE>` to "
"500,000"
msgstr "连接飞控并将 :ref:`CAN_P1_BITRATE<CAN_P1_BITRATE>` 设为 500,000"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hobbywing-dronecan-esc.rst:53
#: 06b71ef8132a490aaa966f9efd20310f 3cadeeb57bc74e1fa3ca6f1b46b15f5b
#: 6078ed67c4b44c2486726091650688db 87234cc65d2449e0931b80cf6c0fdc30
#: a3ec5e18f4bc491babf0a09e422e4aea
msgid "Reboot the autopilot"
msgstr "重启飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hobbywing-dronecan-esc.rst:54
#: 139b35011a93443e889dddf1505b9389 46b4bb8f4fa2486db670c11c12d83e3b
#: a33de560de5b45b48c20e2cf2a96a21a c0cfe5ddb34240b5bbc0f9474faccb80
