msgstr "给 ESC 上电，它们应停止蜂鸣"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hobbywing-dronecan-esc.rst:55
#: 1673ae61592f4ed28e8423575f1d27ed 2c0e5ec6db66413bb362cad4f8444698
#: 367b196324114ccb96bc675d5c761e25 52f778da5b594a3eb13fcb8dac9403f3
#: 57d292f1eed041389531053daca881eb
msgid ""
"Use Mission Planner's Setup, Optional Hardware, Motor Test page's \"Test All"
" Motors\" and all motors should spin"
msgstr ""
"使用 Mission Planner 的 Setup，Optional Hardware，Motor Test 页面的「Test All "
"Motors」，所有电机应能转动"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hobbywing-dronecan-esc.rst:57
#: 23e13ec259214e0dbb2e9f6c7d3b1c51 24e97832b56b498fa02c8f649a3290dc
#: 60ad92cd7c8243f892cb0e66d80ac301 79c8f0b252ba4f1cb0c1c5b0fae9c8e6
#: e4974f79d7cb4ee8ab5578b8025219e4
msgid "Next correct the configuration of each ESC:"
msgstr "接下来更正每个 ESC 的配置："

#: ../../source/docs/common-hobbywing-dronecan-esc.rst:59
#: 076ce0ca40cd47be85fbb712f45ba961 624c0f465fc54a4ab1abc9fa58e36ec2
#: 7137df1a2f244b10868e9be056d6aa8d 864ba49b5c3147aab7a983195fe91962
#: 88577cbd0e284c6e8265288edd90a485
msgid ""
"Ensure the autopilot's :ref:`CAN_P1_BITRATE<CAN_P1_BITRATE>` param is set to"
" 500,000 (reboot the autopilot if modified)"
msgstr "确认飞控的 :ref:`CAN_P1_BITRATE<CAN_P1_BITRATE>` 参数设为 500,000（如有修改则重启飞控）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hobbywing-dronecan-esc.rst:60
#: 11c1fb51549240129161094ef9bafe09 4ea20944886d48648d258b3b4e9a6b10
#: 5280ede7b3f34adeb8d2a5dccab4b488 7c4c87bbff214d8d8014dc8f011449f5
#: e53e64db489242019c1723a2566dbd1d
