"Download and install a the :ref:`DroneCAN Gui<common-uavcan-gui>` (version "
"1.2.25 or higher)"
msgstr "下载并安装 :ref:`DroneCAN Gui<common-uavcan-gui>` （版本 1.2.25 或更高）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hobbywing-dronecan-esc.rst:61
#: 01200a8eebd1459c8b7023f7f19ac09e 339031bb1a6e40df9b47965c35726548
#: 56050a4e5a6149049cec510b9f2a0dcb 875019aab39b4a08a7ad6a06c4bafd0e
#: aad49e3d37094b97beaae04ffdf37246
msgid ""
"Determine the autopilot's MAVLink or SLCAN COM port.  More details can be "
"found on the :ref:`DroneCAN GUI page<common-uavcan-gui>`."
msgstr ""
"确定飞控的 MAVLink 或 SLCAN COM 端口。更多详情可在 :ref:`DroneCAN GUI 页面<common-uavcan-"
"gui>` 找到。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hobbywing-dronecan-esc.rst:62
#: 2c406164cb3a4d078bc038420ade67d4 35b2b6305b6c45db98e2ff00369e7133
#: 6a9e7166a047427d89b74b7ddaf9e6b2 7fec3d39bb584d72837424e708953c23
#: 9c92ca84da1843e698f9a119a44d85cf
msgid "Open the DroneCAN GUI"
msgstr "打开 DroneCAN GUI"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hobbywing-dronecan-esc.rst:64
#: 1794e274fb3a404c99c0374a37445fd0 369735541a48449cb919d8d4e2f930a4
#: 9908bb3168e44c26ad6dd35fbc863d23 9dd869ef179f4d73a1ce8041f90ddc64
#: c813060c61e14e1680cd9aafb7f241a5
msgid "Connect to the MAVLink or SLCAN COM port"
msgstr "连接到 MAVLink 或 SLCAN COM 端口"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hobbywing-dronecan-esc.rst:65
#: 18f2d1da1a6843c993064b9bc026a882 7d4eca60c7eb4c6b9df6171c37cbc15c
