msgstr "从顶部表格中选择一个 ESC"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hobbywing-dronecan-esc.rst:68
#: 02fc2cc2bcf940dca78819d4caaf3b8f 483995f15d0548b08827ec8bcfff7f6d
#: 727f27e7f38e411f90a35c78ba186de8 880d6fb4256b413dbefb81ba32d92689
#: c1a33539706346c6b107012169e03656
msgid "Set the Baudrate to 1,000,000"
msgstr "将 Baudrate 设为 1,000,000"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hobbywing-dronecan-esc.rst:69
#: 2ae7051d8da540fcbdd5e219089925b6 30ad6d58714642db90ba0638af177946
#: c3fe7874ca8b41f69e118398421116c9 e760efc62ec74316a7864e0ca4b51961
#: fafc177dfd7443498c8e79d087ce119b
msgid ""
"Set ThrottleID and NodeID to the ESC number.  This ESC number corresponds to"
" the autopilot's servo/PWM output port number"
msgstr "将 ThrottleID 和 NodeID 设为 ESC 编号。此 ESC 编号对应飞控的舵机/PWM 输出端口编号"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hobbywing-dronecan-esc.rst:70
#: 24ae7d453dfe45e8a44c9d4861890912 39ba6d536f9947aebd9c4d1ab261c12b
#: 50aa0bce5fb542e983861103cf0b5e91 60fe322a25d24bf7a31c2871954e51de
#: ec3e27ee5a9342f3a9a8f1a3c6cdaad0
msgid "The values in the top table should update within a few seconds"
msgstr "顶部表格中的数值应在几秒内更新"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hobbywing-dronecan-esc.rst:71
#: 09d6cbd39dec4a60a71fc6f70c277500 2598eb8a9b5745d28232202639363f68
#: 28e5bd76c78849579945f41d748fe277 38ad6614881f4c5da8d8e98138bfc741
#: 74a530d21d6b4b3597372ba00e211500
msgid ""
"Optionally you may wish to set Msg1Rate (rate at which RPM is sent to "
"autopilot) and/or Msg2Rate (voltage, current temp).  Note Msg1Rate must be "
"greater than Msg2Rate."
msgstr ""
"可选择设置 Msg1Rate（向飞控发送转速的速率）和/或 Msg2Rate（电压、电流温度）。注意 Msg1Rate 必须大于 Msg2Rate。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hobbywing-dronecan-esc.rst:72
#: 11ac46e5d2054831ba6976f8427c6904 202b9a029eb44d4ebdfb59ccecb9e4f1
#: 3835a071aad44ae396c9ed4e1bfd5cc0 7326bb92acf4404783a164e2b6ba9a8b
#: aa26390619f64e99ad3daaa294422e92
msgid "Repeat for each ESC"
msgstr "对每个 ESC 重复以上操作"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hobbywing-dronecan-esc.rst:77
#: 148415b2204043c186d152dd78757f38 57b73feef45b4bafb54254b478070623
#: d4a7cef141004b6392379b446e6003aa dd8c0541a368411eb916aa3d9c559d5b
#: e64ebd7743fe4a8daa2f7b198f1777b2
msgid ""
"Connect to the autopilot and set :ref:`CAN_P1_BITRATE<CAN_P1_BITRATE>` back "
"to 1,000,000"
msgstr "连接飞控并将 :ref:`CAN_P1_BITRATE<CAN_P1_BITRATE>` 改回 1,000,000"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hobbywing-dronecan-esc.rst:80
#: 15621c2d7efe4decbc0812b8ad77c504 9666c2ad1ca64ba3a879ac7fef9a181e
#: ad16647de55b434a9eff2de40737cf0e cb46477d718d47c6b123c82f9cc8b213
#: d301811f6d934b2e93a1d038b1a7a5b0
msgid "Testing"
msgstr "测试"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hobbywing-dronecan-esc.rst:82
#: 0b5a82fcce5847349547d40cecb535c0 0dc91a72ee5a4034bd1a7efec6431ad2
#: 93dfbb56dbea4926a29fcc250618e577 a4bec2d41e314031a261360fe58ef949
#: b02c02134d534ef9b54ef856d8164636
msgid ""
"Once connected the ESC's RPM, voltage, current and temperature will be "
"visible in the ground station and recorded in the onboard logs.  The image "
"below shows where the data appears on Mission Planner's Status screen."
msgstr ""
"连接后，ESC 的转速、电压、电流和温度将在地面站中显示并记录到板载日志。下图显示数据在 Mission Planner Status 界面中的位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hobbywing-dronecan-esc.rst:88
#: 373a91437dfa492b9a1abef7b4ceed5c 400de10dc9c64e9d85f76e579e689e37
#: 57d2326c58b4470cb9b5f7c754aee84e 663903b2a4434a5eb1ff612f05b309f8
#: 9a5152dbd9cd459a94e86afd783041f2
msgid ""
